    "description": "<b>File Recovery - Photo Recovery App</b> is a powerful app that helps you find and recover deleted photos, videos or audio and lost documents files instantly from your device with one click.\ud83d\udc4d\r\n\r\nAre you worried about losing your precious data?\r\nWant to recover deleted photos and videos?\r\nCurious about what your lover hides?\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08 Don't worry, this File Recovery - Photo Recovery App is the choice for you.\r\n\r\n<b>HIGHLIGHT OF FILE RECOVERY - PHOTO RECOVERY</b>\r\n\u2022 Undelete - Recover lost photos, videos, audios and documents.\r\n\u2022 HD Quality - Restore deleted photos and videos no blurry.\r\n\u2022 Quick deep scan - Quick export data for recovery.\r\n\u2022 Preview deleted photos, videos, audios or lost files, docs before recovering.\r\n\u2022 Recognize file formats with Fastest File Recovery - Photo Recovery.\r\n\r\nFile Recovery - File Miner App can scan all data in internal storage and find to recover deleted files you want, especially photos, videos, audios and documents files in various formats with algorithms. It's just like a recycle bin that can help you get back lost files.\r\n\r\n<b>\u267b\ufe0f Recover Deleted Photos</b>\r\nAccidentally deleted photos from the phone gallery? No need to worry when the deleted photo recovery app is here. Just scan photos to recover data with deleted image management. Retrieve deleted photos with phone data recovery - file recovery app for android. It helps to recover deleted photos from internal storage. It's a helpful file recovery app to restore deleted photos in quantity with one click.\r\n\r\n<b>\u267b\ufe0f Recover Deleted Videos</b>\r\nDeleted File Recovery - Deleted Video Recovery will show all scanned videos or search for lost videos to recover deleted videos in phone memory. Recently deleted videos, hidden videos, all can be quickly restored by device management.\r\n\r\n<b>\u267b\ufe0f Recover Deleted Audios</b>\r\nDeleted File Recovery - Deleted Audio Recovery scan out all deleted audio files on your device, quickly filter out target files, and finish file restore in seconds.\r\n\r\n<b>\u267b\ufe0f Recover Deleted Documents</b>\r\nNot only that, the file recovery app can also retrieve all lost documents. Whether it's documents, spreadsheets, PDFs, or any other file format, file recovery data app to bring them back to life.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd12 Private Vault: Data privacy provides a safe space to keep private files with policy protection, all processing is done locally, No files will be accessed or deleted nor uploaded without permission. Highly secure big file recovery!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8c Thank you for choosing our app. Contact us: teammarketing@lutech.ltd",
